WEBVTT

video-title-1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Okutunuulira

observe
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Tunula ku bunene, enkula n’okufaanagana kw’obutuli bw’amaaso gombi.

compare-observation
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Geraageranya obutuli obwa bulijjo n’enkyukakyuka mu langi oba enkula, obunene obutafaanagana n’ebikowe.

video-title-2
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Akatuli k’eriiso okuddamu ekitangaala butereevu

light
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Koleeza Arclight olonde ekitangaala ekisinga. Kozesa ekisenge ekisirifu ekirimu ekitangaala ekitono.

distance
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Gamba omulwadde atunuulire ekintu ekiri ewala.

clear-view
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Kakasa nti tatunuulira mukebera wadde ekitangaala kyennyini.

move-light
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Sembereza ekitangaala eri akatuli k’eriiso okuva ku bbali.

watch
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Tunula ku katuli akataddeko ekitangaala olabe bwe kaddaamu butereevu.

shine-constrict
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Yaka ekitangaala mu liiso olabe akatuli bwe kakendeera.

compare-responses
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Noonya okukendeera okutono oba obutakendeera.

corresponding-examples
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Obutuli obuli ku kkono buyinza okuddamu bwe butyo olw’embeera eziri emabega w’eriiso eziragiddwa ku ddyo.

pupil-colour
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Langi y’akatuli tesalawo bwe kaddaamu ekitangaala.

cataract-constriction
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Ekire kiyinza okufuula akatuli okulabika nga ka kivu oba keeru, naye kasaanidde okukendeera singa ekkubo ly’okuddamu ekitangaala teririna buzibu.
